{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "21845314-5c8f-8314-aadc-2b40890ec8a1",
  "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:51:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linh Singh",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:46:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:46:40-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Lorraine. This is Linh Singh. You know, when I was a girl we lived near the harbor, and my father used to say you could tell the whole neighborhood by which lamps were lit along the water. Every one of them worked. Now I can't say that about Chapel Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:47:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I see. So you're calling about a streetlight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:47:14-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The one by the crosswalk is dark. Has been for days now. I manage a property up here and I walk over in the evening, and it's pitch black where you cross. I don't feel safe, I'll tell you that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:47:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's no good, especially this time of year with it getting dark so early. Can you give me the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:47:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "354 Chapel Street. The crosswalk is right out front, in Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:47:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 354 Chapel Street. And the light that's out, is it on a pole right at the crosswalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:48:08-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The pole right at the corner of it, yes. Not the one down the block, that one works fine. This one is just dead. Nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:48:22-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So the pole at the crosswalk in front of 354 is completely dark, not flickering or coming on and off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:48:35-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Completely dark. I'd have called sooner but I figured somebody else did. Nobody does, I guess. The woman next door talks to me over the hedge every morning, and even she says it's been out. So that's two of us who noticed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:48:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'm glad you called. Do you happen to see a number on the pole? Sometimes there's a little tag with numbers on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:49:13-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on. I'm not going out there in my slippers. [pause] No, I can't see from the window. It's too far and the glass is dirty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:49:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. The address and the crosswalk should be enough for the crew to find it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:49:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So you'll send somebody to check the pole? That's what I want. A crew to look at it and fix it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:49:50-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request for a crew to check that pole. I can't tell you the exact day they'll get there, but it goes on their list as a safety item since it's a crosswalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:50:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A list. Everything's a list. Well, I hope it's a short one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:50:17-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Let me read back what I have. Streetlight out at the crosswalk, pole in front of 354 Chapel Street, completely dark for several days, and you'd like a crew to check it. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:50:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Several days, maybe more than a week, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:50:44-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "More than a week, okay, I'll note that. And the best number to reach you if the crew has questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:50:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0166."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:50:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0166, and that's Linh Singh, S-I-N-G-H?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:51:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. Linh, L-I-N-H."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:51:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. You're all set. If it's still dark in a few days, call us back and we'll check on the request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:51:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you, Lorraine. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:51:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for calling, Ms. Singh. Take care."
    }
  ],
